Z||000006||Sage||08-09-2000||06:42 PM||||SloPonti:<BR>Since you asked, I have about 4 sets of fiberglass fender flares for the cj7.  They are 6 3/4" wide and bolt on directly where the factory flares do.  They will cover a 10x33" tire, and are designed to keep the mud&muck off the body, in addition to looking cool!<P>They are quality glass, gel coated and ready to paint (they should be sanded lightly with #400 first) They sell for $225.00 for a set of four.<P>Just thought I would let you know.  You can email me if you think you might be interested, or know someone else who may be.<P>Thanks for the space;<P>Have a good one! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
