Z||000008||Monkeyman||08-10-2000||02:32 AM||||b lo 0--I prefer Mickey Thompsons personally.  Before I got rid of the CJ5, I put 38" M/Ts on with beadlocks.  Works great on the rocks at about 6psi.  The guy I sold it to put 44"ers on it.  That was just a little too big on a short wheel base 5.  You could almost walk up the inside of the tires to climb into the cab.||||reg||1
Z||000009||ChadMan||08-10-2000||10:20 AM||||Monkey, Boomer - nice Jeeps!<P>I always wanted a CJ5.  Other Jeeps are cool too, and the newer ones are easier to live with on a daily basis, but the CJ5 to me is the epitome of Jeepdom.||||reg||1
